<SAMI>
<HEAD>
<TITLE>The Morning Ferry</TITLE>
<STYLE TYPE="text/css">
<!--
P { margin-left: 8pt; font-size: 20pt; text-align: center; }
.ENUSCC { Name: English; lang: en-US; }
.ELGRCC { Name: Greek; lang: el-GR; }
-->
</STYLE>
</HEAD>
<BODY>
<SYNC Start=1200><P Class=ENUSCC>The morning ferry leaves Piraeus at seven.</P><P Class=ELGRCC>Το πρωινό πλοίο φεύγει από τον Πειραιά στις επτά.</P>
<SYNC Start=3800><P Class=ENUSCC>&nbsp;</P>
<SYNC Start=4100><P Class=ENUSCC><I>Kalimera.</I> Two tickets to Naxos, please.</P>
<SYNC Start=6900><P Class=ENUSCC>&nbsp;</P>
<SYNC Start=7300><P Class=ENUSCC>Deck or cabin?<br>Deck &amp; sea air.</P>
<SYNC Start=9500><P Class=ENUSCC>Look, dolphins!</P>
<SYNC Start=11800><P Class=ENUSCC>&nbsp;</P>
</BODY>
</SAMI>
